#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0001 expect=violation domain=LB
#note "Non-custom LB domain: the define's DOMAIN item is bound to the SDTM Domain Abbreviations codelist (ccode C66734), whose declared CodedValue LB carries alias C99999 -- not among the library's published domain codes {C11111, C22222} -> fires. Authored Sensitivity Dataset caps the finding at one. ⚠ Channel split (PLAN-codelist-terms-returntype.md P2): the real 2-letter submission values (AE, LB) ride #library codelist-terms, the NCI C-codes ride #library codelist-term-ccodes, and the codelist's own ccode/preferred term ride #library codelist-meta. Do NOT put C-codes back into codelist-terms -- feeding C-codes down the submission-value channel was the self-disarming fixture shape this replaces."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library codelist-terms DOMAIN AE LB
#library codelist-term-ccodes DOMAIN AE=C22222 LB=C11111
#library codelist-meta DOMAIN ccode=C66734 pref="SDTM Domain Abbreviation"
#define-xml CDISC-CG0001-define.xml
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt define_variable_ccode=C66734
dataset LB class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBTESTCD type=Char
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | GLUC
